# Testing guidelines

**Source of truth:** [`rules/testing.md`](../../rules/testing.md)

Follow that file for JUnit, Mockito, Testcontainers, unit and integration tests, HTTP API contract tests, layer coverage (controllers, services, domain/state machine, repositories, RAG), and required positive/negative flows. Do not generate frontend tests. Do not duplicate or drift from it here.
